    "$t": "是按怎án-ne生 - 葉仔tsiah濟款"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《葉仔tsiah濟款》</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">/洪明道</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: small;\">(作者是作家、醫生)</span></h2><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: small; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhwEb925feqVjsPz8WYTo9heflboYhmRReCAPcOXiMEdbe1KOSb6Se63XjjHxx75sDjmCHQhNFXN6wxdnkJdThQXlQJjDC9pqKU73fJynuVF2_0bvx6nZIDi5XjY7-i8b30J1pf8FYkmgbgjtuZAWqQnUJ6YYskjiwMwFd9rKnY5PXQEBIG96SuMojwelmK\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhwEb925feqVjsPz8WYTo9heflboYhmRReCAPcOXiMEdbe1KOSb6Se63XjjHxx75sDjmCHQhNFXN6wxdnkJdThQXlQJjDC9pqKU73fJynuVF2_0bvx6nZIDi5XjY7-i8b30J1pf8FYkmgbgjtuZAWqQnUJ6YYskjiwMwFd9rKnY5PXQEBIG96SuMojwelmK\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhHMbIWtFTS1E5ybXi7GPr22oNMtQlNRI9uYbKzwYkVpMeeir59i9SLHEMLxT5ZJS7QQDjDVwRACQ1VQs5frTMXqaXhExbrRn4NwQPkkxRSZiZFMpzLMvvbbnCbcPJ7VFh8WwjPJ4RMiO35obdaYLgIN2BWNhAJ5Y7rRGbH91zVTnbc7MZT8jS3CWu0FDco\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"6071\" data-original-width=\"4299\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhHMbIWtFTS1E5ybXi7GPr22oNMtQlNRI9uYbKzwYkVpMeeir59i9SLHEMLxT5ZJS7QQDjDVwRACQ1VQs5frTMXqaXhExbrRn4NwQPkkxRSZiZFMpzLMvvbbnCbcPJ7VFh8WwjPJ4RMiO35obdaYLgIN2BWNhAJ5Y7rRGbH91zVTnbc7MZT8jS3CWu0FDco=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><img data-original-height=\"6071\" data-original-width=\"4299\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhwEb925feqVjsPz8WYTo9heflboYhmRReCAPcOXiMEdbe1KOSb6Se63XjjHxx75sDjmCHQhNFXN6wxdnkJdThQXlQJjDC9pqKU73fJynuVF2_0bvx6nZIDi5XjY7-i8b30J1pf8FYkmgbgjtuZAWqQnUJ6YYskjiwMwFd9rKnY5PXQEBIG96SuMojwelmK=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></div><br /><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: small; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj4Qjpp2tUN2MJRLBosjhU0jCDvub6bsItmmiP6YS-Rx-hUY4lvSTBIPYGh40lM6cw5hJ8hPmEFA-1cR4AqvhAcvwx8zjQ1AAh3sfwH6xpGtVHNvTcSzDMr-XiMOVsKGg5ev9erBq3QV1Jgu2OMC4DD9BStGEicn6DyIT1VD2aP-wTCW_X5bwHjpg9Bc8Dv\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"6071\" data-original-width=\"4299\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj4Qjpp2tUN2MJRLBosjhU0jCDvub6bsItmmiP6YS-Rx-hUY4lvSTBIPYGh40lM6cw5hJ8hPmEFA-1cR4AqvhAcvwx8zjQ1AAh3sfwH6xpGtVHNvTcSzDMr-XiMOVsKGg5ev9erBq3QV1Jgu2OMC4DD9BStGEicn6DyIT1VD2aP-wTCW_X5bwHjpg9Bc8Dv=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「有人tī--leh--無、有人tī--leh--無？」</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">芯--a聽著有人leh挵窗仔門。伊目睭皮thí開，看in哥哥阿仁tī邊--a睏kah kônn-kônn叫，只好家己起來應門。芯--a人iáu眠眠，ná juê目睭ná行落去樓跤。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">口面hia一个人影，看著面熟仔面熟。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「芯--a，kan-na你tī厝--裡--hiooh？」</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「Hennh--啊，阿爸阿母iáu leh上班，阿媽m̄知去tueh--ah。阿好姨，你揣阮有啥代誌？」</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「Tsit kuānn肉粽beh提來送--lín--lah。」</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「五月節to過--ah，是按怎iáu有粽？」</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「To前兩日仔tuè人去tshit-thô，tse是名產--neh。你提--入-去了，ài緊kā冰冷凍，知--無？」</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">阿媽tńg--來了後，芯--a隨kā講冷凍內底有肉粽。伊neh跤尾neh kah tsiânn食力，tsiah thang摸著頂面ê冰箱門kā冰--入-去。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">阿媽鉸兩粒粽落--來，siòng一時仔久，tsiah kā hē lueh電鍋內底炊。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「阿媽阿媽，是按怎tse肉粽是用炊--ê，m̄是用sa̍h--ê？」</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「你kā看，tse粽ha̍h是m̄是kah lán平常leh食--ê，生做無仝？」</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">芯--a掠粽ha̍h金金siòng，確實生做無啥仝。Tsit款粽ê粽ha̍h看--起-來khah黃，koh有烏烏一點一點。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「Tse是桂竹葉，人北部粽用tsit款葉仔leh包khah濟。Lán tsia̍p leh食--ê，是麻竹葉lueh包--ê。」</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">芯--a想著講，學校升旗開早會，伊若聽kah siān--ah，ē khioh塗跤ê葉仔起來摸，kuân頂葉脈一tsuā一tsuā。用tsíng頭仔細力去lì葉仔，葉仔就一條一條hông拆開--去。若出力juê葉仔，juê kah碎糊糊，ē鼻著芳芳ê青草仔味。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">想bē到，葉仔有tsiah細葉--ê，mā有thang包粽tsiah大葉--ê。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">電鍋跳--起-來--ah，規灶跤lóng米kah葉仔ê芳味。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">阿媽kā肉粽tháu--開，té碗公hōo芯--a試口味。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「芯--a，你食--起-來感覺按怎？」</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「有影無仝--neh，是uân-nā tsiânn好食，m̄-koh按怎講……有淡薄仔成油飯……」</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「我ê查某孫哪ē tsiah巧！」阿媽mā tháu一粒，坐做伙，同齊食。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">（Kā逐家提醒，若無熟sāi ê人來挵門，lán iáu是ài提防，bē-sái凊彩開門--őo！）</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">熱天時，葉仔發kah青lìng-lìng。Beh寒--人，葉仔反黃--去，lak kah規塗跤。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">塗跤ê葉仔khioh起來kā斟酌看，有圓--ê，mā有尖--ê。有ê像葵扇，有ê像跤蹄，有ê ná像lán人ê手面。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">百外冬前，一陣植物學家來到lán台灣。植物學家是研究花草樹木ê人，其中一个號做川上（かわかみ，Kawakami），一个號做早田（はやた，Hayata）。In lóng是日本東北ê人，hia寒--人落雪，he雪積kah不止仔厚，有tang時仔厚kah車to bē駛--得。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">In來台灣，看著lán tsia ê山崙青青青，tsiânn濟m̄ bat看--過ê樹仔。He是偌nī無仝ê所在。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">有一類樹仔，lán tsia人lóng kā叫做楠仔。有一款楠仔葉仔生kah真大片--ê，號做大葉楠。有一款楠仔葉仔leh puh-ínn，幼ínn結規條bē輸豬跤，lán kā號做豬跤楠。Koh有一款，葉仔kā juê hōo碎，ē有臭moo-moo ê味，hông叫做臭屎楠。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">一日，川上tī基隆、瑞芳tsit搭，看著一種楠仔ê葉仔生做無啥仝。講豬跤楠是無成，若講是臭屎楠，mā小可無siāng。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">若án-ne，he是啥mih樹仔tsiah tio̍h？</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">川上kā葉仔挽--tńg-去，thang kah早田參詳。早田看來看去，發現khah早無人記錄--著。Tse確實是一種新ê植物，就kā伊ê學名號做Machilus zuihoensis。Zuihoensis，就是uì日本話ê瑞芳（ずいほう，Zuiho）來--ê。學名是科學家用來分類ê名稱，科學界lóng用學名leh講生物。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">雖bóng號做瑞芳楠，tsit款樹仔台灣全島lóng揣ē著。Lán koh kā伊ê樹皮磨做粉，號做楠仔粉。楠仔粉ē-tàng做拜拜leh攑ê香。就án-ne，tsit款樹仔mā號做「香楠」（hiunn-lâm）。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">後一頁ê圖，畫各種楠仔葉。你kám看ē出--來，有佗位無仝？</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgdBzWYjm9kwJIhns8tBbjO0BYgscYdiP44l7kYAx337_J5GzZS7yF-MB1K1A0NLtZCClhu3fUxPrbP_M4SZRoPoaMoxH91Da3UPNay3XbnWEvyoqLnR5j-QMDaSKI3n4WwXr6fzE_dBUYstsxlJFDtHEa0WR8D7IJ_lvmAKCuYITCUpn5dEIleQoYG2St-\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"438\" data-original-width=\"610\" height=\"460\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgdBzWYjm9kwJIhns8tBbjO0BYgscYdiP44l7kYAx337_J5GzZS7yF-MB1K1A0NLtZCClhu3fUxPrbP_M4SZRoPoaMoxH91Da3UPNay3XbnWEvyoqLnR5j-QMDaSKI3n4WwXr6fzE_dBUYstsxlJFDtHEa0WR8D7IJ_lvmAKCuYITCUpn5dEIleQoYG2St-=w640-h460\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\">頭前講，瑞芳楠也號做香楠。Lán臆看māi，瑞芳楠ê葉仔，是臭--ê iah芳--ê？</div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">答案：</div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\">瑞芳楠ê葉仔uân-nā有臭ta味，有ê所在mā kā伊叫臭屎楠。Khah早ê人無受現代科學教育，in用家己ê方式來kā植物分類。逐所在有無仝叫法，mā是tsiânn sù常ê代誌。國立臺灣博物館本館ê常設展「自然臺灣」，展出tsiânn濟標本，內底就有瑞芳楠。南部山區像田寮（Tshân-liâu）、大崗山（Tuā-kang-suann）、茂林tsia ê所在，ē-tàng看著大葉楠、豬跤楠。</div></div><div style=\"font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">專欄簡介</span></b></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">【是按怎án-ne生】是hōo囡仔看ê科學故事，逐個月一篇。頭先寫囡仔生活中ē拄--著、牽連著科學ê代誌，suà--來解sueh故事內底ê原理。Lán ē照台語實驗小學高雄市路竹區北嶺小學ê課程來行，難度khah深--一-點-仔，加一寡科學史、台灣史。Ē-tàng準做是補充教材，一般學生仔mā ē讀--得。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">配合國小自然：翰林版三上單元1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">核心素養指標：自-E-A1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">學習內容：INb-II-6</span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=A